  },
  {
   "i": 14194,
   "title": "Password reset emails not received and invalid token errors in ME region",
   "description": "We have a critical issue in the Payment Gateway v2 for the Middle East region. Customers are not receiving password reset emails. When they attempt to use links from previous emails or if the email eventually arrives, they receive an 'invalid token' error. This is locking out over 1,200 users who cannot access their accounts to make payments. This is a high-priority blocker for our regional customer base."
  },
  {
   "i": 14195,
   "title": "OAuth Service locking accounts out with elevated privileges in APAC",
   "description": "We are seeing a strange behavior in our OAuth Service in the APAC region. A large number of accounts (over 1,100 users) are being locked out. More concerning is that when these accounts are accessed or audited, they appear to have elevated privileges that were not assigned. We are worried about a potential security breach or misconfiguration in the OAuth token issuance. Please investigate why accounts are locking out and why privilege levels are changing."
  },
  {
