  },
  {
   "i": 14201,
   "title": "HTTP 401 errors and MFA rejections in SSO Integration Module (Staging)",
   "description": "We are encountering HTTP 401 Unauthorized errors when testing the SSO Integration Module in the US-East staging environment. The MFA codes being entered are valid but are being rejected by the system. This is preventing 38 users from logging in for QA testing. We need to know if the MFA configuration in staging differs from production or if there is a bug in the 401 handling during the auth flow."
