   "description": "We are receiving critical alerts about expired certificate warnings in the Identity Vault for the ME production region. Over 20,000 users are being affected. We strongly believe this is caused by a breaking API contract change introduced in a recent update, which has invalidated the existing certificate validation logic. Please investigate the API compatibility regarding certificate handling immediately, as this is bringing down access for a vast majority of our users."
